      "en": "Ten young men who bore Joab’s armor surrounded and struck Absalom, and killed him.",
      "ko": "요압의 병기를 맡은 소년 열이 압살롬을 에워싸고 쳐 죽이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "b3560f1b566a70a419c6b8a0922f1da10def2badeb8280c842ab2caa1f417c2a",
      "translation_text_hash": "1deb0c3156389579d7c654fd661fa083c638961ee5ad0125816aa2d90dd03513",
