      ],
      "en": "Now David was sitting between the two gates; and the watchman went up to the roof of the gate to the wall, and lifted up his eyes and looked, and, behold, a man running alone.",
      "ko": "때에 다윗이 두 문 사이에 앉았더라 파숫군이 성문루에 올라가서 눈을 들어 보니 어떤 사람이 홀로 달음질하는지라",
      "source_text_hash": "4a7703d4e433fee00cf6fdb0471bf7b3c5b9a6f67495ec8636e8f064e92464a3",
      "translation_text_hash": "6342c6d609ca55a3b7258c043dc61b5a0aa9e7434b083ee3cae7d549bc6699da",
