      "en": "The king said, “Come and stand here.” He came and stood still.",
      "ko": "왕이 가로되 물러나 곁에 서 있으라 하매 물러나서 섰더라",
      "source_text_hash": "e44099a1a7534171af4b6b352f9858f0d80fe0890a57f06717d7a5b71a21ec37",
      "translation_text_hash": "55900fcb268abf39610b728a89361d9e2bf8d1e965011bd8a1941d688346ac75",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
